@api = http://localhost:5100

### Ca 1: Trang chu kiem tra trang thai -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### Ca 2: Danh sach san pham -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/products

### Ca 3: Chi tiet san pham ton tai -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### Ca 4: San pham khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### Ca 5: Sai kieu id (chu thay vi so) -> 404 rong do framework chan
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### Ca 6: Tao san pham hop le -> 201 Created + Location
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}

### Ca 7: Tao san pham voi gia am -> 400 Bad Request + ApiError
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham loi",
  "description": "",
  "price": -1
}

### Ca 8: Thieu header Content-Type -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/products

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}
